-- Zyrqon Nova X
-- Standalone high-strength chess-analysis API for Luau/Roblox.
-- Public interface kept compatible with Nova:
--     local move, score = ZyrqonNova:GetBestMoveFromFEN(fen, seconds)
--
-- Major upgrades over the previous version:
--   * PVS / fail-soft negamax
--   * iterative deepening + aspiration windows
--   * stronger transposition hashing and TT bounds
--   * null-move pruning with verification
--   * late-move reductions and check extensions
--   * futility / razoring / delta pruning
--   * tactical quiescence with checking moves
--   * history, killers, countermoves and TT move ordering
--   * tapered middlegame/endgame evaluation
--   * stronger pawn, king, mobility, initiative and piece-activity evaluation
--   * style affects both evaluation AND root candidate selection
--   * time-safe cooperative searching for Roblox clients
--
-- It is still a pure Luau engine. It does not use Stockfish, an external engine,
-- a remote service, or a decompiled game chess engine.

